# 🚁 Prototype

Our prototype integrates environmental sensors with an **ESP32-based embedded system** mounted on a drone platform.

### 🔧 Sensor System

| 🔩 Component    | 🎯 Purpose                    |
| --------------- | ----------------------------- |
| 🧠 ESP32        | Data acquisition & processing |
| 🟢 MQ-4         | Methane/gas sensing           |
| 🔵 MQ-135       | Air-quality-related sensing   |
| 🌡️ DHT22       | Temperature & humidity        |
| 🌤️ BMP280      | Atmospheric pressure          |
| 📍 GPS          | Location & timestamp          |
| 📡 LoRa         | Long-range telemetry          |
| 🌬️ Wind Sensor | Wind speed & direction        |

---

# ⚙️ How EID Works

### 1️⃣ SENSE

Environmental sensors collect readings from the surrounding environment.

↓

### 2️⃣ LOCATE

GPS associates each measurement with a geographical location.

↓

### 3️⃣ PROCESS

The ESP32 collects, processes, and packages the sensor readings.

↓

### 4️⃣ TRANSMIT

LoRa sends the telemetry to the ground station.

↓

### 5️⃣ MAP

GPS-tagged measurements are converted into spatial environmental maps.

↓

### 6️⃣ PREDICT

The AI layer analyzes historical and environmental data to estimate potential pollution trends.

↓

### 7️⃣ WARN

The system generates alerts when configured risk conditions are detected.

