# 📊 Measured vs Predicted Data

The platform clearly distinguishes between real sensor measurements and AI-generated predictions.

### 🔵 Measured Data

Data directly received from environmental sensors.

### 🟣 AI Predicted Data

Estimated pollution trends or risk generated by the prediction model.

> ⚠️ AI predictions are estimates and should not be represented as guaranteed future pollution conditions.

