# 🧪 Prototype Validation

## 🌡️ Sensor Validation

Compare sensor readings under controlled environmental conditions.

## 📍 GPS Validation

Evaluate:

* GPS fix time
* Coordinate stability
* Location accuracy

## 📡 LoRa Validation

Measure:

* RSSI
* SNR
* Packet reception
* Packet loss
* Communication range

## 🌬️ Airflow Testing

Compare sensor behavior with drone motors OFF and ON.

```text
        🚫 MOTORS OFF
             ↓
        Baseline Reading
             ↓
         🚁 MOTORS ON
             ↓
        Sensor Reading
             ↓
          📊 COMPARE
             ↓
    Evaluate Airflow Effect
```

## 🚁 Flight Testing

Evaluate:

* Flight stability
* Battery endurance
* Payload effect
* Sensor boom placement
* Communication reliability

