# ⚠️ Sensor Limitations

The current prototype uses low-cost MQ-series gas sensors.

MQ-4 and MQ-135 readings should currently be treated as **raw sensor/ADC readings** unless the sensors have been properly calibrated and validated.

They should not automatically be interpreted as:

❌ Certified methane concentration
❌ Certified AQI
❌ Regulatory environmental measurements

Further calibration and validation are required for quantitative environmental claims.

